{
  "_comment": [
    "tol_init arm of the CPM bandwidth-transient study.",
    "Measured on the validation replicate: the reported bandwidth sits at",
    "tol_init for the first ~3000 evaluations and is still 68x above the",
    "k-th order statistic of the losses at 13,000. The schedule tightens at a",
    "bounded rate per scheduler call, so the transient is proportional to",
    "log2(tol_init / eps*) -- and the shipped 10.0 is ~1000x the prior median",
    "discrepancy of 0.459, spending 4-5 halvings walking down from an",
    "arbitrary constant. This sweeps tol_init with everything else held.",
    "tol_init is shared by both arms of the matched comparison by construction,",
    "so nothing here favours one method over the other."
  ],
